emonstrated stress resilience (calm in crisis) and strong attention and decision quality, plus crew concern (puts concern for others). A's communication difficulty is a concern but perhaps less severe than B's nasty remarks. So we recommend A.\n\nThus vote: Candidate A.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
